      "html": "<p>The smallest of the striped catfish species from India, all of which were formerly called \"Mystus vittatus\". For a long time the small species was called M. tengara, but currently most scientists believe that the correct name is M. carcio. It attains a maximum length of only 4-6 cm and is well suited for the home aquarium.</p>"
